      "role": "user",
      "content": "i dont even know how to explain it anymore. i just feel so heavy. like every single thing, even just waking up or breathing, takes more energy than i actually have left in me. it's not even sadness anymore, it's just... nothing. i'm so tired of trying to keep the light on when there's nothing left to burn.",
